{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/3f0a8b75f6b86d10da180c5a70f919fe.poster.avif?t=1766883922\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/3f0a8b75f6b86d10da180c5a70f919fe.webm?t=1766883922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/3f0a8b75f6b86d10da180c5a70f919fe.mp4?t=1766883922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luscious 'shrooms await the clever slug...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/a2f4a4c250ebb8359429269ed734ff9b.poster.avif?t=1766883922\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/a2f4a4c250ebb8359429269ed734ff9b.webm?t=1766883922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/a2f4a4c250ebb8359429269ed734ff9b.mp4?t=1766883922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Set out with your pals to munch them all...\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/6f5c9525cf017d5e5400ede3999dee74.poster.avif?t=1766883922\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/6f5c9525cf017d5e5400ede3999dee74.webm?t=1766883922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/6f5c9525cf017d5e5400ede3999dee74.mp4?t=1766883922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Don't be careless with your moves, or you'll dry up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/c00d803a2d3ecbef2a3855d57e8f09cc.avif?t=1766883922\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get yourself to some tasty <strong>'shrooms</strong> using <strong>limited movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put that slug brain to work solving increasingly difficult 2D\u00a0<strong>spatial puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your mind by mastering the abilities of <strong>3 unique slugs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over <strong>60 puzzles</strong> across <strong>3 funky zones</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>slime</strong> wisely!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735720/extras/c31b7393bc8674ada2aa34b8e1b879ed.avif?t=1766883922\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to experiment! Undo, restart, and undo across restarts when solving a puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All's fair! No timed inputs or things left to chance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your progress! The game autosaves after completing a puzzle and when moving through the zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize options! Separate music/SFX volumes, toggles for rumble/screenshake, and settings for display/audio device.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn as you go! A few context-sensitive input tutorials get you playing quickly and are available anytime for reference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No (or very little reading) required! There's a little English around the edges, but all core gameplay elements are language-independent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photosensitivity warning: This game contains effects that may induce seizures or motion sickness in a small percentage of players.<br><br>No generative AI was used at any point in the creation of this game. Just sweat and slime!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Goo-over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/a147692d75124d105e36017c58f5e09289f018d3.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh air","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/bb723afb6f407192ee08e4b85b13c5fe0f1678d3.jpg"},{"name":"It's butte-iful!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/5b20e0dbba6b80c1e063afe247a26a4513eb3d9d.jpg"},{"name":"Extra sloppy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/269c8250ea0c223ea2538f8f4451a9316d23f220.jpg"},{"name":"Slugbuds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/d8e9c3ad942b6e2abda8ed7fa7b4a6d648c7c794.jpg"},{"name":"Backpacking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/b4888971e7b33cbee63f20742f5114b80acc5c35.jpg"},{"name":"Hole in one","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/87dbfce044b3c68960fffa084e77aa3289885f42.jpg"},{"name":"Love tap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/308299cfaf7ce5ffeedc327513a689597b55a473.jpg"},{"name":"Slugbus Express","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/a04642ce36f1078fbc5c6a284940efebb82759fe.jpg"},{"name":"Ticket to slide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3735720/b71585f78012248bb5da24df378f0b705ff14bf6.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageb